B.alT=new A.cj('First Sherlock reads the file itself: Content Credentials, AI labels and camera details. When those are missing, it looks for the patterns AI tools leave in pictures and writing, and weighs every clue by how reliable it is.\n\nNo check is perfect. When the clues mostly point one way but not strongly, you\'ll see "Leans human" or "Leans AI". When they clash, or the text is too short, you\'ll see "Can\'t tell" instead of a guess.\n\nEverything runs on your phone, so your pictures and text never leave it. Content Credentials can\'t be signature-checked here, so they give "Likely AI", not "Confirmed AI".',null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
